    "description": "True DirMO-24 XGBoost: three multi_output_tree ensembles jointly predict h1-24, h25-48 and h49-72 using frozen Top30 inputs (237 columns per block). Only h49-72 uses pointweight4: per-target y>=550 km/s weight4 else1, normalized by each training-horizon mean; h1-48 uses ordinary L2. Relative to e2000fs_dirmo_24_feat30_pointweight4, only the first two blocks lose their high-target weights. Same 900 rounds, depth3, learning rate0.03, seed42, training-mean scalar initialization and CPU4threads. ACE lag0, causal forward fill, target+72h maturity, purged internal validation and fixed F1/F2 target cutoffs 2026-02-26/2026-05-29. No official-score tuning; inherited Top30 selection was official-exposed, so these are not fresh holdouts. The published script replays archived forecasts, not live inference or retraining. Training source, nine boosters and per-round losses are archived; model inference timing is recorded separately.",
